{
  "draft_email": {
    "to_addr": "[Customer Email]",
    "subject": "Global Shipper Quarterly Reconciliation – Action Required",
    "body": "Dear [Customer Name],

Thank you for your inquiry regarding Global Shipper. In line with our Global Shipper Standard Operating Procedures (GS-SOP-2024-0291), financial inquiries trigger our standardized quarterly reconciliation workflow to ensure audit-ready records and transparency.

To complete the reconciliation, please upload the latest bank transfer confirmations and reconciliation reports to our shared review platform at https://docs.globalshipper-hub.net/shared/upload. Uploading these documents promptly helps ensure all transaction records are aligned before the audit cycle closes.

For reference, Global Shipper orders follow the standard NET 30 terms as outlined in MSA-2023-0847.

If you have questions about the documents required or need assistance with the upload, please let us know and we will assist promptly.

Best regards,
NexPort Logistics Team"
  }
}

